\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 President Clinton accused vaccine manufacturers of pursuing profits over children\u8217 s health. A proposal to distribute free vaccines to all children was downsized. The administration also abandoned plans for a national warehouse to store and distribute vaccines after the project was widely criticized as unworkable.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Dr. Robbins became so frustrated, Ms. Freeman, his wife, recalled, that she witnessed him tell a top drug company official at a meeting: \u8220 I bet there\u8217 s a memo in your desk that says somewhere, \u8216 There are more measles cases, up the price. There\u8217 s a dip in measles, up the price.\u8217 \u8221 }
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The official just smiled, she said. \u8220 He didn\u8217 t deny it.\u8221 }{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260
\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Anthony William Robbins was born on Jan. 9, 1941, in Manhattan. His father, I.D. Robbins, was a civic reformer and a builder who constructed low-cost homes in Brooklyn and the Bronx. His mother, Carolyn (Marx) Robbins was an editor and columnist.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Dr. Robbins received his bachelor\u8217 s degree in biochemical sciences in 1962 from Harvard University, graduated from the Yale School of Medicine in 1967 and received a master\u8217 s degree in public administration from the Harvard Kennedy School in 1969. He trained in internal medicine as an intern and resident but chose a career in progressive health policy.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 After serving as Vermont\u8217 s health commissioner, he held a similar position in Colorado from 1976 to 1978. He barred smoking in the health department\u8217 s offices long before workplace bans extended nationwide. And he sought the end of the use of plutonium \u8212  and favored a shutdown \u8212  at the notorious Rocky Flats nuclear weapons plant outside Denver. It closed in 1992.}
